            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naiwe Sulemaani mwana wangye, omanye Ruhanga wa sho, ogume omuheereze n'omutima gwawe gwona kandi ogwekundiire; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA acaaka emitima yoona, kandi amanya enaama zoona n'ebiteekateeko byona. Ku orimusherura, oryamubona; kwonka ku orimurugaho, aryakucwa obutagaruka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
