          "text": " Bwanyima Daudi yaagira omutabani Sulemaani ati: Ba ow'amaani, ohame, okikore. Otatiina, kandi otahahaaza omutima; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga, niwe Ruhanga wangye, ari hamwe naiwe; tarikutsigaho, kandi tarikuhemukaho, okuhitsya ahu emirimo yoona ey'ebirikorwa omu nju ya MUKAMA erihwera. ",
